{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3a4fbe8b807646efaf609ba71113281a487db40bcdd8224d86fe8d989941e2d5", "ja": "VRゲーム内、未知のフィールドに飛ばされ\nたアイドル達。なぜかログアウトできなく\nなっており、手分けして情報収集に出る。\n騎士団ギルドを訪れたジュリア達は、違反\n者排除用の自律型AIに襲われてしまう。", "zh": "在VR游戏中被传送到了未知原野\n的偶像们。不知为何无法登出，\n于是大家分头前去收集情报。\n造访骑士团公会的茱莉亚等人，却遭到了\n违规者排除用自律型AI的袭击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8ef1aed728e7d647fa107619b1e010fcc7106b7c8ad138ecc718766fa4af479b", "ja": "―フルダイブ型VRゲーム（？）　どこかの町―", "zh": "—全沉浸式VR游戏（？）　某座城镇—", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "0ada009f55725d21c30abccd86ae4ccecd30ca7a0fd0bd458a5ae21dbaa39eb1", "ja": "えーっと……どうなってんだ、こりゃ？\nいきなり景色が変わっちまったぞ？", "zh": "呃……这是怎么回事？\n景色突然就变了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "d3c1ca90633308c1fc456364b3646ded03b5ef09fc314fc29b1e5502c4b69374", "ja": "MAPも開けないし、知らないエリアにいるみたい……\n別の場所に飛ばされたのかな？", "zh": "地图也打不开，好像来到了未知的区域……\n是被传送到别的地方了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "5bbb46d40e20b7cb9f14fb9d896c82740a37f05d5af0f00b1d2b27bededd5877", "ja": "でも、ウチらログアウトしようとしたよな？\n二人一緒に操作をミスったのか？", "zh": "可是，我们不是正准备退出登录吗？\n难道是我们两个一起操作失误了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2d5ed722b0b19c78529d89444a7fe7ad4c395be0fa9af5daaea3873a7e63ffca", "ja": "あっ、ジュリアーノ？　琴葉さんもいる！\nよかった～！", "zh": "啊，茱莉亚？琴叶也在！太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "371ab24810595cfadecdfd11cbf623b6d5beeae11e88e368e37e207fd093282a", "ja": "あれっ？　どうしたの、みんな。\nGGOをやってたんじゃなかった？", "zh": "咦？大家这是怎么了？\n不是在玩GGO吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8d8d3ee6bb32a164213e46f8aa087a8a2d866a72680e8f22e0e63a36514b516", "ja": "はい、やっていました。ですが、ログアウトしようと\nしたところ、この知らない町に……。正直、迷子です。", "zh": "是的，刚才还在玩。不过，正准备退出登录时，却来到了这座陌生的城镇……说实话，我迷路了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "4864e67b759a7ab2257e76c616cf4e24477a3f9d3382dc9994f2d4555709f4c1", "ja": "そのあと何度ログアウトボタンを押しても、\nダメなんです……。あの、ジュリアさん達は？", "zh": "之后不管按多少次退出登录按钮，都不行……那个，茱莉亚先生他们呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "3abbea1652126e8118c581a6af702c9ce3a0fafe2e94a05cc7a5c396749ca73d", "ja": "は？　ダメってどういうこと……。\nって、マジっぽいな。琴葉はどうだ？", "zh": "哈？你说不行是什么意思……。\n等等，看起来好像是真的。琴叶那边怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "86caafe5aa9bcf52653c608cf1633ba8948ccfd2da721984f03e7f11141883a5", "ja": "うん、無理みたい……。\nどうしよう、困ったな……もうレッスンなのに。", "zh": "嗯，好像不行……  \n怎么办啊，真伤脑筋……明明马上就要上课了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9591c9bb85b78cb989cd923e47aff1e37364d277f1bd14b7a5fec45ee6354f6e", "ja": "う～ん……。じゃあ、しょうがないから、\nログアウトできるまでゲームしちゃいましょうか♪", "zh": "唔……那也没办法，我们先玩会儿游戏，直到能登出为止吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "95dc1b87373a6790c0f2968f6976cca477154654032e1724a8a652a2ef72b643", "ja": "ダメ！　きっと{$P$}も\n心配してると思う。きっと私たちを探してくれて……。", "zh": "不行！我觉得{$P$}肯定也在担心我们，一定正在找我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "9fcca43162d5be065a1e14e37808b52e772bf1936dc2395e978b2982b15c84d1", "ja": "ね、寝てるところを見つけられちゃうんだよ！\nそんなの、絶対ダメ！", "zh": "不、不小心被发现睡着了啊！那种事，绝对不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "9c5d4a30c78d798af978d4b19b8f98eda20d4cdbbf553e7e1c5db6d551deb761", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nまあ微妙だよな、それは。", "zh": "是、是吗……\n那确实有点微妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "24dde1183ddb58044c536ced73c1394018d3f29507a9140b82ca53a1421a9c18", "ja": "わたし達、とにかく情報を集めるために、\n町を歩いてみようって話してたところだったんです。", "zh": "我们刚才正商量着，\n为了总之先收集情报，就去镇上到处走走看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "5899ee26a4855b6a6b04ff9b633fc6e1311a0524f507aaf957d9c6ee2338057c", "ja": "よし、じゃあウチらもそうするか。\n手分けして、色々話を聞いてみようぜ。", "zh": "好，那我们也这么办吧。\n分头去打听各种消息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1016_null", "source_sha256": "9a811eac81dac8e4a36822241cf4865ed595341174696507b59c34b9e6a02c0d", "ja": "（ワーワー、キンキン！　ガキンッ！）", "zh": "（哇哇、尖锐刺耳！锵！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "679e4285f6dc540ad4ac2ef5165fd4cbd1664a44a4d16b23cc0c1c2f3d629bba", "ja": "とりあえず、ここがこの辺りで一番デカい建物だよな。\n騎士団とか？　そういう雰囲気だけど。", "zh": "总之，这里应该是这一带最大的建筑了吧。\n骑士团之类的？感觉就是那种地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "f20693d29b508afb8e410a809971c76462a9ce5a666839928978bc8cfb70d792", "ja": "ええと……ごめんくださーい！", "zh": "那个……有人在吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1019_kishi", "source_sha256": "13f4c739f63433664b0490dde52300aefb74eb254f8648cfe248e93d79799795", "ja": "はーい！　入団希望の方ですか？", "zh": "好的！您是希望入团的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "57601b82fc62675ff7b33cf228306662b3eb009656b2c1f636035ac73bad255d", "ja": "あ、いえ、そういうのじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，不是的，不是那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1021_kishi", "source_sha256": "9d97b98b5acd72442c0be0cfe1e1489fb2f634129c973dcb361c9ecbdcda2bb6", "ja": "はっ！？　入団希望じゃ、ない……\nということは、道場破りの方ですね！？", "zh": "啊！？不是来申请入门的……\n\n也就是说，您是来踢馆的吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "c0e0cea336d3adb46319f6c7ed31ab3edbbc014ce4f29560c27d8b0d4cfeab9e", "ja": "待て待て、なんでそうなるんだ！？", "zh": "等等等等，怎么就变成这样了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1023_kishitati", "source_sha256": "eb064ea6c9f39d6807482a4b2b49dde74bc575aac87e101fdd7d01a9e1ed195a", "ja": "「「「「ウオオォォーッ！！！」」」」", "zh": "““““呜哦哦哦——！！！””””", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "f34d9a74aee6b374dbbd4e172cfa6f085e3529528cb479ad6589ba0a0fa9b483", "ja": "きゃっ、たくさん集まってきちゃった……！\nあの、私たち別に、戦いにきたわけじゃ……。", "zh": "呀，好多人聚过来了……！\n那个，我们并不是来打架的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1025_kishidancho", "source_sha256": "a8295500c58adc831be53f78ea94ffeb9a2d1bef6d0f3fe73158077ce74f6d42", "ja": "問答無用！　我ら武闘派ギルド『100万年騎士団』！\n語りたいことは、剣で語るのみ！", "zh": "不由分说！我们就是武斗派公会“100万年骑士团”！\n想说的话，就只用剑来说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "67397d62df3993066f6352b725b2ad6655053cb863d46438281641a07b559ea2", "ja": "う、うーん……やるしかないのかな。\nジュリアちゃん下がって、ここは私が……。", "zh": "唔，唔……看来只能打了呢。\n茱莉亚你退后，这里交给我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "e7ed717971b4fe8a5ebbeef049199868393a734ede87252989d3729a259b217b", "ja": "何言ってんだ、仲間だろ？　あたしも戦うよ。\n琴葉はあたしが守ってみせるぜ！　……なんてな♪", "zh": "你在说什么呢，我们是伙伴吧？我也要战斗。\n我会保护好琴叶的！……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "496f74188cdbff3b792d2af6a364a5497b383a2784803f304bdff005f7dc675b", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん……うん！　背中は任せるね。", "zh": "茱莉亚……嗯！我的后背就交给你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd25f517c010827af64d76e999158c3ae7e6e3c1d40eb5c71e55940d43082827", "ja": "よし、そんじゃ行くぜ……", "zh": "好，那就出发吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "07c5b749d58778645613fd07cbd765555c07875fc4a3a760b6ea546c828fe3f4", "ja": "はぁーっ！！！", "zh": "哈——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "9f02177364fc2dbd47bf64aa148224e9af3dbfc37afa6d315040b9c71c6aa75d", "ja": "やぁーっ！！！", "zh": "呀——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1032_kishitati", "source_sha256": "fb626bb98c3879bfbc8e833f77367055247c73874200b9b7487f508e19553609", "ja": "「「「「グアアァァーッ！！？？」」」」", "zh": "““““呜啊啊啊——！！？？””””", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1034_motodancho", "source_sha256": "bb695500c4557e88f943d50408ad6a063c02575ebd1347e8d3ac63a546e0ac0e", "ja": "なるほど……つまり団長殿たちは、別の場所から突然\n飛ばされて、ログアウトできなくなってしまったと？", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，团长大人一行是突然从别的地方被传送过来，然后就没法登出了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "be34bffee10f1af23b8425a36069fc47e6953b280500038c18a567513a461a84", "ja": "ええ、そうなんですけど……あの、\n団長殿っていうのは、やめてくれませんか？", "zh": "嗯，是这样的，不过……那个，能不能别再叫我“团长大人”了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1036_motodancho", "source_sha256": "23e20915263eb58691c9b3464eb7a1c033b07060fc89a563708a84f4e9ce9b34", "ja": "いえ、我々はあなたに完敗です！\nその強さ、美しさ……あなたこそ、我らが団長！", "zh": "不，我们输得彻彻底底！\n那份强大与美丽……您才是我们的团长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1037_kishitati", "source_sha256": "4378fd97c59cdcc89d589b2a422f052fb29d424e66065aa7272b939c50e73eec", "ja": "「「「「ワアアァァーッ♪♪♪♪」」」」", "zh": "““““哇啊啊啊——♪♪♪♪””””", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3ddc22971a91322d064ec76947b81829cc94f701075bd89fa5c2c9085ea469a", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん、どうしよう……！", "zh": "茱莉亚，怎么办……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "bf0cca801cc2c6cb9f1f6e8d19907ca09c0a74d6cbad62d8c5e697a4c35f9b41", "ja": "いや、あたしに振られても……。", "zh": "就算你甩给我，我也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1040_motodancho", "source_sha256": "852fd414e68f5c588b63c34394a81b6c617a5be9b13fcc84885b11a70f78ef97", "ja": "でも我々は、普通にログアウトできるようですね。\nもうGMコールはしましたか？", "zh": "不过我们似乎可以正常登出。\n已经呼叫GM了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "63d2160eb16df281b5803536214443fea7608c33cf131e79ec3c88237cf888fb", "ja": "GM……ああ、ゲームの管理人を呼び出すヤツか！\nなるほど、思いつかなかったよ。サンキュ♪", "zh": "GM……啊，就是呼叫游戏管理员的那个吧！\n原来如此，我完全没想到。谢啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1042_017kth", "source_sha256": "3f9063b1a54eff258856ab532a788d439d5fe44e0b2abf5fb86c59e7c1ce0a4a", "ja": "やっぱり慣れてないとだめだね。すぐ送ってみよう！\n……サポート、問い合わせ……うん、これで。", "zh": "果然还是得熟悉了才行呢。马上发过去试试吧！\n……客服支持、咨询反馈……嗯，这样就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "8b1dcaa7abeaa089dd8f9d3b8de85137469757c655e2966106b89f1e326fffc6", "ja": "よし、じゃあ返事が来るまで待って……。", "zh": "好，那就等回复过来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1044_se", "source_sha256": "a40330c4564d47ecd9ea95b291f1fd27052d6cbf4b598955f5cb2aea2c6b6a6a", "ja": "ザザッ……ザーッ……ヴンッ！", "zh": "沙沙……沙——……嗡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1045_050jul", "source_sha256": "457b94742a360c9f31dd8b3814cb4f38af5b7c8d6d90ae13282a907227988bae", "ja": "なんだ……？　うわっ、なんか急に人が出てきたぞ！？\nこ、こいつらがGMってヤツなのか？", "zh": "什么……？　哇，怎么突然冒出人来了！？\n难、难道这些家伙就是所谓的GM？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1046_sinkunoskishi", "source_sha256": "25e5724a7ac26798bc9f197a14cebb14b7b1d8476bd40cc26bc9e3dd7e073ec5", "ja": "……。規約違反行為が確認されました。\n調査・検証のため、あなた方の身柄を拘束します。", "zh": "……已确认存在违规行为。\n为了进行调查与验证，现将拘留各位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1047_motodancho", "source_sha256": "cb13e28c1a44c32c20c58e1b19f24d85007c33d8e12f9d2ca0a1aa2f30dd9923", "ja": "い、いえ、GMではありません！　あれは……\n『深紅の騎士団（ナイツ・オブ・カーディナル）』！", "zh": "不、不是，不是GM！那是……\n“深红骑士团”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1048_motodancho", "source_sha256": "2b1998d879722a78a95e71181023cf672b14c91b581801119ac37ba57e48dc91", "ja": "バグ利用者や、チーター……そういう\n規約違反者を強制排除するための、自律型AIです！", "zh": "这是为了强制排除利用漏洞者、作弊者……也就是违反规定者的自主型AI！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1049_017kth", "source_sha256": "5d0722046322893b14e47fbc1e6a3f1a98acbeafc55523783229c09c8a1e37b3", "ja": "え、違反者って……私たちが！？\n待ってください、GMと話をさせてくれませんか？", "zh": "咦，违规者是……我们！？\n请等一下，能让我们和GM谈谈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1050_sinkunoskishi", "source_sha256": "17343ecbef5f09c5caf855ef56ee5563710dad553d7106263e7d6568690a7237", "ja": "当該2アカウントのアバターを、非正規と確認。\n重大な違反となり、処罰対象となります。", "zh": "已确认该2账号的形象违规。\n此行为属于重大违规，将作为处罚对象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "6aea97a83325fedbba9624b6098115d2796be0ed8c23f37a5c72e917cc53733b", "ja": "ど、どうしよう？　ジュリアちゃん。\n話を聞いてくれないみたい……。", "zh": "怎、怎么办？茱莉亚。\n她好像不愿意听我说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1052_050jul", "source_sha256": "d6fdc504ce42a3d56c9ea398bcaf3f8a4a6d7c9ddb365e1272cf0dc5ffef4767", "ja": "つーか、急に処罰ってのも気に食わないな。\nOK、やれるもんならやってみな！", "zh": "话说回来，突然就要处罚什么的，我可不爽。  \n行啊，有本事就来试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1053_017kth", "source_sha256": "ac382cf7505c9fe0c2560a8d73396b0f154133f325619b55756a64a4778ddf55", "ja": "いいのかな……でも、時間もないし。\nええと……ごめんなさいっ！", "zh": "这样好吗……可是，也没时间了。\n那个……对不起了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1054_017kth", "source_sha256": "445c3d5c256d9371e58bb2b0f2ddd7c2c5ae35c8ae0600f972b11c42e419b800", "ja": "えい、やぁーっ！！！", "zh": "嘿，呀——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1055_050jul", "source_sha256": "1098620ee8af748964d451c574c54633e93d3be4ceefd94fe4adca190620f4ff", "ja": "いっくぜえっ！！！", "zh": "上咯——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1056_se", "source_sha256": "f7b6ed943d63d3b1e5b4e75d450cde5ccffcb87012463acb45666e505749db1e", "ja": "ガキイィーンッ！！！！", "zh": "锵——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1057_050jul", "source_sha256": "62c2f4358741f708aa94c42cc0cdea724e3716931770d1dc3ecdcd32172ccebf", "ja": "……っ！？\nなっ……効いてねえ！？", "zh": "……唔！？\n怎么会……居然没用！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1058_sinkunoskishi", "source_sha256": "6183e3342864bbab5963374aa3ce76a3aa76261d7e50adc5e825c774d0fb962d", "ja": "無駄です。我々の盾はいかなる攻撃も通しません。\nそれでは、反撃を開始します。", "zh": "没用。我们的盾牌不会让任何攻击穿透。\n那么，开始反击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_03_1059_017kth", "source_sha256": "622f93e4f0def247c7aee50258e6bf2ab14dd85d7b5f0252375d375fe93c1ca2", "ja": "あっ……ジュリアちゃん！　危ない！", "zh": "啊……茱莉亚！危险！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
